<h1>Specification Acknowledgement</h1>

<p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">
  Job: <%= @job[:job_number] %> | <%= @job[:name] %><br>
  Date: <%= format_date(today, :long) %>
</p>

<h2>Property Details</h2>

<table>
  <tr>
    <td style="width: 35%; background: #f5f5f5;"><strong>Site Address</strong></td>
    <td><%= @job[:full_address] %></td>
  </tr>
  <% if @job[:lot_number].present? %>
  <tr>
    <td style="background: #f5f5f5;"><strong>Lot/Plan</strong></td>
    <td>Lot <%= @job[:lot_number] %> on Plan <%= @job[:plan_number] %></td>
  </tr>
  <% end %>
  <tr>
    <td style="background: #f5f5f5;"><strong>Client(s)</strong></td>
    <td><%= @client_names %></td>
  </tr>
</table>

<h2>Acknowledgement</h2>

<p>
  I/We, <strong><%= @client_names %></strong>, acknowledge and confirm that:
</p>

<ol>
  <li>
    I/We have received and reviewed the following contract documents:
    <ul style="margin-top: var(--space-2);">
      <li>Building Contract</li>
      <li>Contract Specifications</li>
      <li>Plans and Drawings</li>
      <li>Colour Selections</li>
      <li>QBCC Consumer Building Guide</li>
      <li>QBCC General Conditions</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li>
    I/We have had the opportunity to ask questions and seek clarification on any
    aspects of the specifications I/we did not understand.
  </li>
  <li>
    I/We understand that the specifications form part of the building contract
    and any changes or variations may incur additional costs.
  </li>
  <li>
    I/We understand that all selections (colours, fittings, fixtures) must be
    made within the timeframes specified in the contract to avoid delays.
  </li>
  <li>
    I/We have been advised of the standard inclusions and exclusions applicable
    to the contract.
  </li>
</ol>

<h2>Allowances</h2>

<p>
  I/We acknowledge that the following allowances have been included in the contract price:
</p>

<table>
  <tr>
    <th style="width: 50%;">Item</th>
    <th style="width: 25%;">Allowance (inc. GST)</th>
    <th>Notes</th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>Floor Coverings</td>
    <td></td>
    <td></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>Light Fittings</td>
    <td></td>
    <td></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>Kitchen Appliances</td>
    <td></td>
    <td></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>Landscaping</td>
    <td></td>
    <td></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>Driveway & Paths</td>
    <td></td>
    <td></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>Fencing</td>
    <td></td>
    <td></td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p>
  I/We understand that if the actual cost of items exceeds the allowance, I/we will
  be responsible for paying the difference. If the actual cost is less than the
  allowance, the difference will be credited.
</p>

<%= render "qbcc_clause" %>

<%= render "signature_block" %>
